Third-party notices
===================

This file will list license texts for crates.io / git dependencies shipped
with gbtui binaries and examples.

Until the first tagged release, run:

    cargo tree --workspace

and consult each crate's license field. Ratatui (MIT OR Apache-2.0) and
crossterm (MIT) are the primary TUI dependencies.

